Package: HistoneMod
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Analysis of Histone Post-Translational Modifications
Version: 0.6.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jie", "Hua", email = "jie.Hua@bmc.med.lmu.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Marco", "Borso", role = "ctb"),
    person("Beyza", "Bozdag", role = "ctb"),
    person("Axel", "Imhof", role = "ths")
    )
Description: Runs a local 'shiny' application for quantitative analysis of
    histone post-translational modifications from Skyline-like peptide-level
    CSV exports. The package validates input tables, computes relative peptide
    abundances, and provides interactive PCA, heatmap, and barplot workflows
    together with plot export, table export, and quick PDF reporting. A small
    programmatic API is also included for preprocessing and plotting in
    scripted analyses.
